<title>POLAND: Poland's Tychy to issue muni bonds in 1998.</title>
<headline>Poland's Tychy to issue muni bonds in 1998.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's southern city of Tychy will issue municipal bonds in 1998 but has not determined the size or length of the offer, its chief financial officer said.</p>
<p>Helena Szarkowska told Reuters that revenue raised from the issue would likely go toward housing construction. She gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
